cff-version: 1.3.0
title: pyRiemann-qiskit
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
version: 0.6.0
date-released: "2026-07-04"
url: "https://github.com/pyRiemann/pyRiemann-qiskit"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pyRiemann/pyRiemann-qiskit"
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  pyRiemann-qiskit is a Python library that extends pyRiemann with quantum computing
  capabilities via Qiskit. It provides quantum-enhanced classifiers for Riemannian
  geometry-based Brain-Computer Interface (BCI) and EEG signal classification, including
  support for QAOA, VQC, quantum kernels, and nearest convex hull methods.
